    "                prompt alert (SIM registered twice, line suspension,",
    "                Fuliza limit increase, fake prize).",
    "  CMA_CBK     - Capital Markets Authority / Central Bank of Kenya investor",
    "                alerts on unlicensed schemes.",
    "  DCI         - Directorate of Criminal Investigations warnings on",
    "                recruitment and online investment fraud.",
    "  PRESS       - Kenyan press reproducing scam SMS verbatim (Tuko, the Star,",
    "                Africa Check fact-checks of circulating posts).",
    "  UNVERIFIED  - plausible but not traced to a published case. Low weights;",
    "                replace these from your own confirmed reports first."
  ],

