  "_counter_terms_note": [
    "Anti-fraud content quotes the same phrases as the bait. A regulator",
    "advisory, a bank security page and a news explainer all say 'never share",
    "your PIN', so with a real lexicon they score like the scam unless something",
    "pulls them down. These subtract before the 0-100 clamp. They were not",
    "needed with the placeholder lexicon; they are load-bearing with this one."
  ],
